* F3a L(I) ladder: 9 forced-current branches, 0..8 A through 150 uH
* DCR as a series resistor (ngspice-47 L has no Rser parameter)
.temp 27
I1 0 NLI1 PWL(0 0 1u 0.0 401u 1.0)
R1 NLI1 NLV1 0.038
L1 NLV1 0 150u
