R5 NLI5 NLV5 0.038
L5 NLV5 0 150u
I6 0 NLI6 PWL(0 0 1u 5.0 401u 6.0)
R6 NLI6 NLV6 0.038
L6 NLV6 0 150u
I7 0 NLI7 PWL(0 0 1u 6.0 401u 7.0)
R7 NLI7 NLV7 0.038
